<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - Seijo Corp rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Seijo Corp rated.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Institute of Research</p>
<p>Ltd has assigned Seijo Corp a &quot;B&quot; rating, Daiwa Securities</p>
<p>brokers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute</p>
<p>assigns a &quot;B&quot; rating to issues whose values it sees</p>
<p>moving within 10 percentage points in either direction</p>
<p>of the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index over</p>
<p>the next six months.</p>
</text>
